Implementation: S6 UNEXPLAINED steps on seeds 1, 2, 3, ten of ten repetitions each.
Model: S8 PASS (TLC, once).
Implementation: S8 PASS on seeds 1 and 3; UNEXPLAINED steps on seed 2, ten of ten repetitions.

