    40	  `tmp/`, before a mailbox operation releases any reply for delivery. Restart
    41	  reads only those fields; volatile role, commit index, replication state,
    42	  pending administrative requests and timers are reset. Observation counters
    43	  are external instrumentation and survive process restart.
    44	* Replicate the entire suffix starting at nextIndex. Initialize nextIndex to
    45	  lastIndex+1 and matchIndex to zero, including newly contacted peers. On a
    46	  failure decrement nextIndex, bounded below by 1; on success set it to the
    47	  request's last index+1 exactly, even for reordered replies. Retry on heartbeat
    48	  ticks, and immediately after failures and new appends. No election no-op.
