    51	  configuration. Process incoming requests without membership checks. A same
    52	  epoch extend makes a candidate a follower. Reject lower epoch requests with
    53	  an epoch-bearing negative reply. A higher epoch in any message resets role
    54	  and vote before processing. Timers reset on granted ballots and accepted-epoch
    55	  extend requests, including requests failing the previous-entry check.
    56	* Handle administrator requests in a FIFO per coordinator. An add catches up
    57	  via three rounds (a round completes on a successful extension acknowledgement);
    58	  an acknowledgement matching the current full journal completes catch-up at
    59	  once. Contact an add target before membership using the same extension logic.
    60	  Abort catch-up on a full election-timeout interval without progress or on an
