   162	
   163	## Mutations
   164	
   165	Selected by `model/run.sh --mutation <id> <scenario>` and, for the shared files, by `model/run.sh --mutations`. The unmutated model is `Mutation = "none"`.
   166	
   167	- `double_vote`, derives: J1.1. Used for S1, S2, S3. A candidate who belongs to its configuration becomes coordinator in the new epoch inside `Elect`, with no grants. The check that the voter has not voted for someone else in that epoch is skipped as well. Two members can be coordinator of one epoch.
