   191	
   192	## Declared limitations
   193	
   194	The finished checks are safety checks inside these bounds. `FairSpec` is defined and is not the specification TLC ran.
   195	
   196	`MaxEpoch` is 3, `MaxLogLen` is 4, and `MaxRounds` is 3, for the reasons in the bounds table. A member starts an election only when all of the following hold: the member is in its own configuration; no other up member is already a candidate; and there is no up coordinator, of an epoch at least the member's own, with both link directions open. That last test does not look at whether the coordinator's configuration contains the member. `double_vote` skips it. Concurrent campaigns and the split votes they produce are outside the check. A removed member who can still exchange messages with such a coordinator does not campaign. There is no empty heartbeat once a follower is caught up. The reachable-coordinator test stands in for the timer reset the specification describes.
