     7	- The design's members, messages and state as actions; J1.1, J1.3 and J1.5 from `replay/contract.md` as invariants; the failure model's cells as environment actions.
     8	- A compiler from a scenario file (`replay/scenario-format.md`) to a TLC configuration that constrains the environment to the scenario's steps while exploring every interleaving the scenario leaves open.
